\description{
\code{wrap_bipl5_gg()} is the \pkg{ggplot2} counterpart of
\code{\link{wrap_bipl5}}: it takes the same two-dimensional \pkg{biplotEZ}
objects and returns an ordinary \code{ggplot} object instead of a reactive
